`count <= (count0 | 0xFFF) + (count0 & 0xFFF) * (uint64_t)0xFFF` was failing,
and also once the following assertion `ATOMIC_LOAD_N(uint64_t, &qp->users, __ATOMIC_ACQUIRE) <= (uint64_t)0xFFF`
```C
    do {
        count = ATOMIC_LOAD_N(uint64_t, &qp->users, __ATOMIC_ACQUIRE);
        OPENSSL_assert(count <= (count0 | 0xFFF) + (count0 & 0xFFF) * (uint64_t)0xFFF);
    } while (count != (uint64_t)0);

    for (count = 0; count < 99; count++)
